<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 12:52:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>250 年前，美国把一切都押在了信任上。这个赌注正在再次受到考验</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/america-250-trust-needs-to-be-restored-markets-business-government/</link><description>自由企业的未来取决于重建让公民、市场、机构和盟友共同努力的信任。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2285448400-e1785337058143.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/america-250-trust-needs-to-be-restored-markets-business-government/</guid></item><item><title>三星北美首席执行官表示，智能手机只是家庭环境人工智能的切入点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/22/samsung-smartphone-entry-point-ambient-ai-home/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Yoonie-Joung-Final-Headshot-2025-scaled-1-e1785583370423.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 09:07:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/22/samsung-smartphone-entry-point-ambient-ai-home/</guid></item><item><title>尽管中国有996文化，DeepSeek创始人梁文峰表示，他的员工不加班，甚至没有KPI：“没有人管理他们”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/deepseek-founder-liang-wenfeng-workers-dont-do-overtime-or-kpis-china-996-culture/</link><description>当硅谷竞相采用中国残酷的 996 文化时，DeepSeek 的创始人表示，他的价值 600 亿美元的人工智能公司没有 KPI，也没有加班。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2196672039_88f134.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:19:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/deepseek-founder-liang-wenfeng-workers-dont-do-overtime-or-kpis-china-996-culture/</guid></item><item><title>安东尼·斯卡拉穆奇：不要让政治让美国付出数字经济的代价</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/anthony-scaramucci-clarity-act-trump-crypto-bipartisan/</link><description>自就任特朗普白宫以来，我一直是特朗普最直言不讳的批评者之一。但这项立法是随着立法者提出合理的担忧而演变的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/mooch-e1782163226710.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/anthony-scaramucci-clarity-act-trump-crypto-bipartisan/</guid></item><item><title>克里斯托弗·诺兰的《奥德赛》传达了战争永恒而悲惨的一面</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/christopher-nolan-matt-damon-odyssey-moral-injury-ptsd/</link><description>马特·达蒙 (Matt Damon) 的《奥德修斯》戏剧化地描述了一种被临床医生称为精神伤害的病症——与创伤后应激障碍 (PTSD) 不同——这种病症至今仍出现在退伍军人身上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2286159304-e1785516192228.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/christopher-nolan-matt-damon-odyssey-moral-injury-ptsd/</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊的安迪·贾西 (Andy Jassy) 看到了一个价值 1 万亿美元的云，建立在美巡赛 (PGA Tour) 等业务的基础上，该公司用人工智能广播取代了服务器卡车</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/amazon-andy-jassy-cloud-trillion-pga-tour/</link><description>AWS 刚刚公布了 422 亿美元的收入，这是 18 个季度以来最快的增长，而人工智能平台上个季度的支出比推出以来每个季度的支出总和还要多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2287737479.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/amazon-andy-jassy-cloud-trillion-pga-tour/</guid></item><item><title>华尔街隐藏的招聘渠道不是常春藤盟校文凭，而是能让你被录用的几率增加三倍的队友</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/wall-street-recruiting-pipeline-ivy-league-sports-teams-hiring-edge/</link><description>一项针对超过 120,000 名常春藤盟校毕业生的新研究发现，更衣室关系而非文凭才是进入顶级金融公司的真正把关者&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-876642784-e1785528266422.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/wall-street-recruiting-pipeline-ivy-league-sports-teams-hiring-edge/</guid></item><item><title>“人们可以从零到 100”：Z 世代如何通过直播拍卖应用每月赚取 26 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/how-is-gen-z-making-260000-per-month-livestream-auction-app-tilt/</link><description>联合创始人 Abhinavan Thanendran 和 Neil Shah 最初是“工作伙伴”。现在他们领导着一家价值超过 5000 万美元的初创公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-1400000784.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/how-is-gen-z-making-260000-per-month-livestream-auction-app-tilt/</guid></item><item><title>“引人注目的等待”的兴起：解释 Z 世代为何排队的 19 世纪经济理论</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/31/conspicuous-waiting-why-gen-z-posts-in-line/</link><description>Z 世代不只是排队等候。托尔斯坦·凡勃伦（Thorstein Veblen）肯定能准确地认识到他们在做什么。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2279403020-e1785416746321.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/31/conspicuous-waiting-why-gen-z-posts-in-line/</guid></item><item><title>Coinbase 和 Robinhood 正处于激烈的竞争之中，本周的第二季度财报将显示谁拥有优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/28/coinbase-and-robinhood-are-locked-in-a-heated-battle-ahead-of-q2-earningsbut-only-one-is-being-called-the-industrys-first-hyperscaler/</link><description>事实证明，Robinhood 在实现收入来源多元化方面做得更好，但人工智能商业和代币化股票的新兴领域将及时提振 Coinbase。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Fortune-Coinbase-Robinhood.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 20:07:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/28/coinbase-and-robinhood-are-locked-in-a-heated-battle-ahead-of-q2-earningsbut-only-one-is-being-called-the-industrys-first-hyperscaler/</guid></item></channel></rss>